_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_112","text":"I think these silver pools that are scattered around are where buildings used to stand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_113","text":"The building must have come into contact with the silver liquid, and then melted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_114","text":"Fortunately, natural materials don't seem to be affected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_115","text":"The nearby grass, trees, and wooden posts appear to be untouched.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_116","text":"We should avoid any areas with man-made structures moving forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_117","text":"Leviathan mentioned that mixing Dark Matter with other materials could yield something like a dissolving agent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_03_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_op","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_03_118","text":"